name: sim.setScriptStringParam
description: Deprecated. Use sim.setObjectStringParam instead
luaSynopsis: sim.setScriptStringParam(int scriptHandle, int parameterID, string/bytes parameter)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setScriptStringParam(int scriptHandle, int parameterID, buffer parameter)
inputs:
1. scriptHandle: handle of the script, or sim.handle_self
2. parameterID: identifier of the parameter to set. See the list of all possible script parameters
3. parameter: parameter value (can contain embedded zeros)
outputs:
